{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB真人騷《女神配對計劃2》近日爆出嚴重意外，陳星妤與陳若思在水上遊戲環節爆發激烈肢體衝突。女方遭對手猛烈施襲導致身體多處嚴重挫傷，恐怖畫面曝光後瞬間觸發全網討伐。事件更令其中一方甜美形象徹底崩壞，隨後爆發連串公關災難。</p>\n<h2>陳星妤猛攻扯衫兼「奪命叉頸」 跌落水仍強行壓頂</h2>\n<p>在節目水上騎膊馬對決環節中，陳星妤與陳若思正面交鋒時場面完全失控。畫面清楚顯示陳星妤先是一手扯住對手衣服並出手推臉，其後演變成雙手反手箍頸強行將對方扭向下方。當陳若思失去平衡跌落水中時，陳星妤更整個人雙腳凌空壓在對方身上，用力將其頭部強行撳入水中。連串近乎摔角鎖喉動作令現場所有人嚇呆，完全超出普通遊戲應有分寸。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827303340148_6438464306ae7fc31448ec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"LHKOEjk4lAAs7nHj4LhBVyb5Qb0CZ6bwenB7tnpwe7Y.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827303340148_6438464306ae7fc31448ec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827478652934_13805333776ae7fc32ea748.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"gCdNsaTZW2uG19_Arm_8abx5UwAgA06j-84Tz_vOE88.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827478652934_13805333776ae7fc32ea748.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827658719337_20973314026ae7fc34bdc9d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KR2fczhrxAGFDmF8MKiZA7jurTRPA-fgbt37O27d-zs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827658719337_20973314026ae7fc34bdc9d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827820236363_8224151936ae7fc3663570.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"885485152_17912866527476871_314788948653411688_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827820236363_8224151936ae7fc3663570.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>猛攻扯衫兼「奪命叉頸」（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827967788097_5678980106ae7fc37d311e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"884550610_17912866578476871_3335822974036866383_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358827967788097_5678980106ae7fc37d311e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828137726309_16066946876ae7fc39808bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"881132498_17912866629476871_315337456573272813_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828137726309_16066946876ae7fc39808bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>陳若思曬頸部大片紅腫傷痕 網民怒斥：究竟玩遊戲定殺人</h2>\n<p>賽後陳若思在社交平台公開傷勢照片，其頸部及鎖骨周圍出現大面積紅腫及明顯瘀傷。大批觀眾隨即在社交平台洗版炮轟，直指陳星妤手段極度粗暴。網民紛紛留言直斥「玩個遊戲啫，使唔使咁大力？又箍頸又撳人落水，你玩遊戲定攞人命？太恐怖！」以及「反手箍頸，尊攻人哋條頸，頸部神經血管咁多，出事真係好危險！」，更有觀眾狠批施襲者勝負欲過強且心狠手辣，要求其立即退出節目。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828249060725_6093029766ae7fc3ab251a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"884502266_18646242478020348_3531671279752995346_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828249060725_6093029766ae7fc3ab251a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳星妤發文自責道歉稱「太投入」</h2>\n<p>面對排山倒海抨擊，陳星妤隨後轉發陳若思受傷動態並發表公開道歉聲明。她在文中表示「睇返今次節目，我有認真反省。當時太投入比賽了，冇控制分寸同力度，心裏真係唔好受。Amber，抱歉令你受傷了。見到你嘅瘀傷，我好自責，希望你快啲好返」。她試圖透過自責言論平息觀眾怒火，將過火行為歸咎於比賽過於投入，未有拿捏好遊戲尺度。</p>\n<h2>網民不收貨批陳星妤綠茶道歉</h2>\n<p>儘管陳星妤已經低頭認錯，但大批網民對其道歉聲明完全不買賬。網民認定其舉動純粹因輿論發酵才作公關挽尊，紛紛留言炮轟「要睇完觀眾咁多負評先識反省，你覺得觀眾會改觀咩？」、「專登網上道歉畀人睇，成個post都好有綠茶味」。更有觀眾指出「現場弄傷人嗰陣唔見你即刻收手道歉」，形容其外表與行為落差極大，直斥「睇到你人品，心地都幾壞」，令其一貫甜美形象瞬間毀於一旦。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828580979836_18459924476ae7fc3defa9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.44.56.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828580979836_18459924476ae7fc3defa9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828688614268_19406008836ae7fc3f14492.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.44.45.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828688614268_19406008836ae7fc3f14492.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828803631106_1359134256ae7fc40261ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.44.32.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828803631106_1359134256ae7fc40261ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828853553954_14174253446ae7fc40abff1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.43.56 (1).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828853553954_14174253446ae7fc40abff1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828938378331_14098692836ae7fc4184b3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-02 at 10.50.21.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179358828938378331_14098692836ae7fc4184b3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:20:23.756831+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1253,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T04:18:58.491608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:18:18.541292+00:00","content_hash":"3139762f6fd6229bfdcf2da008fbb79da367d37e68b0fab9dbda3e4bb81de071","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}